Project Title: student management system

1. ABSTRACT
The Student Management System is a simple web-based application developed to manage student details in an organized and user-friendly way. The system provides fields to enter a student's name, register number, department and email address. It also provides a search facility to find student records quickly and an Actions section for managing the displayed records. The project is designed using HTML for structure, CSS for presentation and JavaScript for interactive functionality. The application is deployed using GitHub Pages so that it can be accessed through a web browser.

2. INTRODUCTION
Managing student information manually can take time and may lead to errors or difficulty in finding records. A Student Management System provides a simple digital solution for entering and viewing student information. This project demonstrates the development of a responsive web interface with basic student record management features.

3. OBJECTIVES
To create a simple and user-friendly student management interface.
To add student information such as name, register number, department and email.
To provide a search option for locating student records.
To display student details in a structured table.
To provide action controls for managing student records.
To deploy the project online using GitHub Pages.

