5. SYSTEM FEATURES
Student Name input field
Register Number input field
Department input field
Email input field
Add Student button
Search Student field
Student table with S.No, Name, Register No, Department and Email columns
Actions column for record-related operations

6. SYSTEM WORKING
The user enters the student's name, register number, department and email address in the input fields. After selecting Add Student, the application can display the student information in the table. The Search Student field can be used to locate a particular record. The Actions column is intended for operations on individual student records. The interface is designed to keep student information easy to enter, view and manage.

